Forget about Luffy.

42
00:02:47,100 --> 00:02:48,217
He could take care of himself.

43
00:02:48,300 --> 00:02:49,877
Now let's go find some food.

44
00:02:49,960 --> 00:02:51,237
We can get to work after that.

45
00:02:51,320 --> 00:02:53,360
They're all?

46
00:02:58,720 --> 00:02:59,550
this safe.

47
00:02:59,633 --> 00:03:01,877
What's wrong, Karoo? Mr. Three's ship!

48
00:03:01,960 --> 00:03:04,577
I thought we took care of
that creep for good already.

49
00:03:04,660 --> 00:03:05,697
I'm certain it's him.

50
00:03:05,780 --> 00:03:07,677
That ship couldn't even run without Mr.

