59
00:03:23,260 --> 00:03:24,090
What happened?

60
00:03:24,420 --> 00:03:26,120
Well, someone died.

61
00:03:26,520 --> 00:03:29,077
Apparently, he suddenly dropped dead
right in the middle of the restaurant.

62
00:03:29,160 --> 00:03:29,990
He just died?

63
00:03:30,760 --> 00:03:34,577
Yeah, he just up and keeled over
during a conversation with the owner.

64
00:03:34,660 --> 00:03:35,860
