80
00:04:10,973 --> 00:04:12,599
It's an incredibly deadly creature.

81
00:04:13,840 --> 00:04:15,722
I can't believe I can burn this.

82
00:04:17,020 --> 00:04:18,600
I came back to life!

83
00:04:25,060 --> 00:04:26,760
Um are you all right

84
00:04:31,220 --> 00:04:35,757
Sorry about that fell asleep You were

85
00:04:35,840 --> 00:04:39,137
asleep that doesn't make
sense You were right

86
00:04:39,220 --> 00:04:43,926
in the middle of a conversation And now
you're just eating like nothing happened

87
00:04:44,940 --> 00:04:48,477
Jeez what's all the commotion about
anyway We thought you had dropped out

88
