middle of a public place like this.

98
00:05:31,500 --> 00:05:35,040
Even for division commander
of the Whitebeard Pirates.

99
00:05:37,140 --> 00:05:39,300
Hello, Portgas D. Ace.

100
00:05:40,460 --> 00:05:41,700
Huh? No way!

101
00:05:42,000 --> 00:05:43,588
Not the Whitebeard Pirates!

102
00:05:43,820 --> 00:05:46,157
I knew I'd seen that
mark on his back before.

103
00:05:46,240 --> 00:05:49,475
You mean this weirdo is one
of the white-beard pirates?

104
00:05:49,840 --> 00:05:53,840
It's the mark of the white-beard
pirates, but what is he doing here?

105
00:05:54,920 --> 00:05:55,960
