115
00:06:36,180 --> 00:06:39,540
I'd just like you to come
with me quietly. No thanks.

116
00:06:39,800 --> 00:06:41,120
I think I'll pass.

117
00:06:42,280 --> 00:06:44,160
Yeah, figured you'd say that.

118
00:06:46,320 --> 00:06:51,297
I'm here in Alabasta trying to hunt down
another pirate at the moment to be honest.

119
00:06:51,380 --> 00:06:55,837
I have no real interest in capturing you
right now then just look the other way.

120
00:06:55,920 --> 00:06:59,497
I'm afraid I can't do
that not as long as I'm a

121
