Oh, yeah, Tony has an
incredibly sensitive nose.

157
00:08:39,020 --> 00:08:39,850
This stuff?

158
00:08:39,933 --> 00:08:42,309
Some of it does have
a really strong smell.

159
00:08:43,580 --> 00:08:46,637
You smell just like an angel
in a field of fresh flowers.

160
