Yeah, this oasis, you said
it's called Yuba, right?

165
00:08:58,060 --> 00:09:02,178
Yes, that's correct, but first we'll
have to travel through the desert

166
00:09:02,620 --> 00:09:03,450
Amazing!

167
00:09:03,580 --> 00:09:06,620
This is seriously the
best food I've ever tasted

168
00:09:07,260 --> 00:09:10,160
Uh, yes, thanks a lot, but you see, sir

169
