193
00:11:02,220 --> 00:11:03,577
This is bad.

194
00:11:03,660 --> 00:11:06,257
My Gum-Gum moves don't work
against this guy at all!

195
00:11:06,340 --> 00:11:08,277
I just have to make a run for it now.

196
00:11:08,360 --> 00:11:10,360
Yes, sir.

197
00:11:10,520 --> 00:11:11,737
Would you like a cool towel?

198
00:11:11,820 --> 00:11:12,877
It's quite refreshing.

199
00:11:12,960 --> 00:11:14,497
This desert kingdom really is hot.

200
00:11:14,580 --> 00:11:17,300
Catch that guy It's Straw Hat! Yes, sir!

201
00:11:18,760 --> 00:11:19,660
I've got him!

202
00:11:25,700 --> 00:11:27,940
Tajiki, gather the marines at once!

203
00:11:28,180 --> 00:11:31,317
