219
00:12:09,466 --> 00:12:10,537
Because the Marines are here.

220
00:12:10,620 --> 00:12:11,450
Marines?

221
00:12:11,533 --> 00:12:13,217
Let's just find Luffy as fast as possible

222
00:12:13,300 --> 00:12:14,917
