243
00:13:00,680 --> 00:13:06,220
Captain, that straw had a spine to
finish. Not good! Here it comes! What?

244
00:13:07,000 --> 00:13:14,402
Not good!

245
00:13:14,485 --> 00:13:15,315
Not good! Eat hay!

246
00:13:24,820 --> 00:13:25,740
You again.

247
00:13:26,940 --> 00:13:28,160
Just give it up.

248
00:13:31,460 --> 00:13:34,840
While you may have the power
of smoke, mine is fire.

249
00:13:35,120 --> 00:13:37,417
