of us would be pointless.

250
00:13:37,500 --> 00:13:39,257
It would probably go on forever.

251
00:13:39,340 --> 00:13:40,170
All right.

252
00:13:40,253 --> 00:13:42,217
Looks like the Mystery Man
has devil for his powers.

253
00:13:42,300 --> 00:13:43,740
Who is this guy anyway?

254
00:13:44,040 --> 00:13:45,120
That you, Ace?

255
00:13:45,740 --> 00:13:49,760
You haven't changed a bit,
Luffy. It is you. Really?

256
00:13:50,240 --> 00:13:52,597
Wow, did you eat a devil
fruit or something?

257
00:13:52,680 --> 00:13:54,580
Yeah, the flame flame fruit.

258
00:13:54,920 --> 00:13:57,177
We'll secure the
perimeter, Captain Smoker.

259
00:13:57,260 --> 00:13:59,377
Anyway, now's probably
not the time for chatting.

260
